msgid "File"
msgstr "Fajl"

msgid "Other (own registry or list)"
msgstr "Oħrajn (reġistru jew lista tiegħek)"

msgid "DVB-I loads the channel list from the internet. To do so, LinDVB contacts the registry or service list server whose address you enter, the servers that host the channel logos and, when the programme guide is switched on, the broadcasters' programme guide servers. These servers see your IP address and the time of the request. If you enter a postcode, it is sent to the service list server."
msgstr "DVB-I itella' l-lista tal-istazzjonijiet mill-internet. Biex jagħmel dan, LinDVB jikkuntattja r-reġistru jew is-server tal-lista tas-servizzi li ddaħħal l-indirizz tiegħu, is-servers tal-logos tal-istazzjonijiet u, meta l-gwida tal-programmi tkun mixgħula, is-servers tal-gwida tax-xandara. Dawn is-servers jaraw l-indirizz IP tiegħek u l-ħin tat-talba. Jekk iddaħħal kodiċi postali, jintbagħat lis-server tal-lista tas-servizzi."

msgid "Enter the address of a service list registry, or of a service list directly, below."
msgstr "Hawn taħt daħħal l-indirizz ta' reġistru tal-listi tas-servizzi, jew direttament ta' lista tas-servizzi."

msgid "Preferred audio format"
msgstr "Format tal-awdjo preferut"

msgid "As broadcast"
msgstr "Kif imxandar"

msgid "Stereo (MPEG / AAC)"
msgstr "Sterjo (MPEG / AAC)"

msgid "When a channel or file has this sound in the same language, it plays first."
msgstr "Meta stazzjon jew fajl ikollu dan il-ħoss fl-istess lingwa, jindaqq l-ewwel."

msgid "Dolby Digital (AC-3)"
msgstr "Dolby Digital (AC-3)"

msgid "Dolby Digital Plus (E-AC-3)"
msgstr "Dolby Digital Plus (E-AC-3)"

msgid "Number"
msgstr "Numru"

msgid "Name A–Z"
msgstr "Isem A–Ż"

msgid "Name Z–A"
msgstr "Isem Ż–A"

msgid "Picture quality"
msgstr "Kwalità tal-istampa"

msgid "Sort by"
msgstr "Issortja skont"

msgid "All"
msgstr "Kollha"
